<para>LLM prompts follow a fixed structure so that the score parser is robust:</para>
<para>SCORE: &lt;float 0.0–1.0&gt; RATIONALE: &lt;one sentence&gt; MISSING: (optional bullet list)<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>item 1</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>item 2 UNGROUNDED: (optional bullet list)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>claim 1 HINTS: (optional bullet list)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>suggestion</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>This format is enforced in the system part of each prompt. </para>
